  "title": "Lysosomal Aging and Metabolite Signatures",
  "summary": "A multitissue atlas of lysosomal aging reveals a metabolite signature shared with lysosomal storage disorders, while changes in lysosomal metabolites are associated with both aging organs and lysosomal storage diseases.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "A multitissue atlas of the metabolite changes lysosomes undergo during aging was constructed using a suite of tools for rapid lysosomal isolation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Aged lysosomes in brain, heart, and muscle show altered metabolite profiles that are associated with lysosomal storage disorders.",
